Scope

The MIT licence above covers the source code, analysis scripts and tests in this
repository.

The derived research records produced by this project, i.e. the files under
evidence/, splits/ and results/, are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The manuscript sources in paper/, when present, and the Springer Nature template
files are not covered by either licence.

The derived records contain image file names, patient identifiers and labels
taken from two third-party collections. The images themselves are not
redistributed here, and both collections remain under their own terms:

  * NJN (Abdulrazzak et al., 2023), CC BY 4.0
      https://zenodo.org/records/7825810
  * NeoJaundice (Wang et al., 2023), CC0 1.0
      https://springernature.figshare.com/articles/dataset/
      NeoJaundice_Neonatal_Jaundice_Evaluation_in_Demographic_Images/22302559

Reuse of the derived records must also honour those terms, including the
attribution required by the NJN licence and the usage notes of the NeoJaundice
release, which state that the data are not intended for the development of
diagnosis-oriented algorithms and models.
